# iOS 6 SpringBoard, as an option on the pinned Popit contour.
#
# The owner's ruling is that the Popit shell is the pinned baseline and every other form is an
# option layered on it. This form used to declare its own window frame, a 30px taskbar, a 60%
# tab strip, 18x16 window buttons and its own title metrics, which replaced the pinned contour and
# the slot sizes. Those rules are gone: the frame, the 48px bar, the cells at ink 3 by 16 and the
# four resize grips all come from openlock_pinned.css, and this form cannot move them.
#
# What is left is the option surface: the form's identity and whatever colour rules a scheme hands
# it. tools/contour_options_gate.py refuses a geometry rule here, so the inheritance cannot drift.
form	ios
	label	iOS 6 SpringBoard
	renderer	generic
